msgid "Minimization of functions"
msgstr "函数的最小化"

msgid ""
"The minimization of general functions of one or more variables can be "
"carried out using the command:"
msgstr "一个或多个变量的通用函数的最小化可以使用以下命令执行："

msgid ""
"The optimization method, as well as finer control over *func*, can be chosen"
" using the ``METHOD`` directive"
msgstr "优化方法，以及对 *func* 的更精细控制，可以使用 ``METHOD`` 指令来选择"

msgid ""
"where *key* defines the optimization method. Valid options for *key* are:"
msgstr "其中 *key* 定义了优化方法。\\ *key* 的有效选项有："

msgid ""
"``BFGS`` Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno conjugate gradient method, which "
"uses numerical gradients (default)"
msgstr "``BFGS`` Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno 共轭梯度法，使用数值梯度（默认）"

msgid ""
"``SIMPLEX`` Downhill simplex method, which uses only function evaluations"
msgstr "``SIMPLEX`` 下山单纯形法，仅使用函数求值"

msgid "Options to these methods, *key1, key2, …*, are:"
msgstr "这些方法的选项 *key1, key2, …* 为："

msgid "Miscellaneous directives (separated by semicolons or linebreaks)"
msgstr "杂项指令（用分号或换行分隔）"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Geometry optimization"
msgstr "几何优化"

msgid "Basis function optimizations"
msgstr "基函数优化"

msgid "Intersection points"
msgstr "交点"
